<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome | Project29M</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center p-6 pt-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full text-center">
        <div class="mb-10 flex justify-center">
            <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-blue-200">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Secure Portal <span class="text-blue-600">Project29M</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            A professional-grade management system featuring robust authentication, 
            role-based access control, and comprehensive audit logging.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-24">
            <a href="/auth/login" class="px-8 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-md shadow-blue-200">
                Sign In
            </a>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="px-8 py-3 bg-white text-slate-700 font-semibold rounded-lg border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors shadow-sm">
                Create Account
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Platform Lifecycle & Features -->
        <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-12">Platform <span class="text-blue-600">Workflow</span></h2>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-left">
                <!-- Feature 1: Post -->
                <div class="group p-2">
                    <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mb-4 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-all group-hover:shadow-md">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Publish Insights</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                        Verified users can author and publish rich-text posts. Share updates or technical documentation across the organization instantly.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature 2: Like -->
                <div class="group p-2">
                    <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mb-4 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-all group-hover:shadow-md">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Community Likes</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                        Engagement is verified. Users can 'Like' posts to acknowledge value, with all interactions tracked via secure audit logs.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature 3: Comment -->
                <div class="group p-2">
                    <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mb-4 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-all group-hover:shadow-md">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Threaded Feedback</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                        Collaborate through comments. Discussion threads allow users to provide context and feedback on any live platform content.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature 4: Audit -->
                <div class="group p-2">
                    <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mb-4 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-all group-hover:shadow-md">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04kM12 21.75c-2.67 0-5.14-.95-7.07-2.54A11.95 11.95 0 0112 12.75c2.67 0 5.14.95 7.07 2.54A11.95 11.95 0 0112 21.75z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit Control</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                        Every post, like, and comment is timestamped and logged, providing admins with a comprehensive security trail.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 text-slate-400 text-sm">
        &copy; 2024 Project29M. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>